  "prefLabel": "Plc 904.06 Application for Initial Massage Therapist License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 904.06 Application for Initial Massage Therapist License. Any individual who meets the qualifications for licensure stated in Plc 904.01 who wishes to engage in the practice of massage therapy in New Hampshire shall apply by complying with Plc 304.01, subject to the following:\n\n(a) On or with the profession-specific supplement required by Plc 304.01(a)(3), the applicant shall provide the documentation required by Plc 904.07;\n\n(b) No criminal background check shall be required; and\n\n(c) The fee shall be the application processing and licensing fee specified in Plc 1002.24, provided that an applicant who is active military or a military spouse shall not pay the fee.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc900.html"
